00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:43.000
Press and hold, and that will give you the option to delete, and you swipe up.

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:47.469
Or you can hit right here up at the top and that will delete all of your open apps that you'd no longer want to use.

00:04:47.630 --> 00:04:52.089
